    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0310_rival_05",
      "hash64": "F9E347BA49837128",
      "text": "等等！哪有這樣的！\\n你別教[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她奇怪的事情！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
