      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "common_0310_botan_09",
      "hash64": "269F34F80545984A",
      "text": "下決定的人是[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她自己。\\n……是這樣沒錯吧？妮莫，派帕。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
